    "**Event:** Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 - Vishnu Institute of Technology  \n",
    "\n",
    "## Part 1: Theoretical Predictions (\"Think Before You Run\")\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. Original Circuit (Standard Bell State $\\vert{}\\Phi^+\\rangle$)\n",
    "- **Gates:** Starts in $\\vert{}00\\rangle$, applies $H$ on $q_0$, then $CNOT(q_0, q_1)$.\n",
    "- **State Transformation:**\n",
    "  $$\\vert{}00\\rangle \\xrightarrow{H_0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\vert{}00\\rangle + \\vert{}10\\rangle) \\xrightarrow{CNOT_{0,1}} \\vert{}\\Phi^+\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\vert{}00\\rangle + \\vert{}11\\rangle)$$\n",
    "- **Prediction:** The outcomes are perfectly correlated. Only `00` and `11` will appear, each with ~50% probability. `01` and `10` will not appear.\n",
    "- **Expected Counts (100 shots):** Approximately `{'00': ~50, '11': ~50}`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. Modified Circuit (Flipping Correlation to $\\vert{}\\Psi^+\\rangle$)\n",
    "- **Modification:** Add exactly **one** $X$ gate on qubit 1 ($q_1$) before measurement (Total: $H + CNOT + X = 3$ gates $\\le 4$ gate limit).\n",
    "- **State Transformation:**\n",
    "  $$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\vert{}00\\rangle + \\vert{}11\\rangle) \\xrightarrow{X_1} \\vert{}\\Psi^+\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\vert{}01\\rangle + \\vert{}10\\rangle)$$\n",
    "- **Prediction:** The correlation changes from identical outcomes to completely anti-correlated outcomes. \n",
    "- **Will 00 and 11 dominate?** No. `00` and `11` vanish.\n",
    "- **Could 01 and 10 become more frequent?** Yes, `01` and `10` now dominate with ~50% probability each.\n",
    "- **Expected Counts (100 shots):** Approximately `{'01': ~50, '10': ~50}`."
   ]
  },
